  "body": "`crates/app/src/operation/first_traverse.rs` has 427 lines on `main` (4d6b75e77). AGENTS.md \"400-line files\" says that no source file grows past about 400 lines. The fix for #3148 adds 5 more lines, and its worker did not split the file, because that is outside the scope of #3148.\n\nExpected: split the file along a domain seam (for example the user-frame reading `in_user_frame` and the per-law verdict mapping) into a sibling module. Make no change of behaviour. The first-traverse test binaries (`first_traverse`, `first_traverse_table`, `first_traverse_table_tilt`, `first_traverse_posed`, `first_traverse_rotary`, `first_traverse_mill_turn`, `first_traverse_rotary_mill_turn`) must pass without change.\n",
